@startuml
'[brief] Segmented transition simulated via two consecutive transitions. The intermediate state acts as a junction: when the trigger fires the FSM walks through both segments before settling.

'[code] private:
'[code] bool door_open = true;

[*] -> Locked
Locked --> Step1 : unlock [door_open] / door_open = false
Step1 --> Unlocked : / door_open = true
Unlocked --> Locked : lock

@enduml
